Subject: [PATCH] Phase 5 part 1: hosted websites, forms and knowledge base

Forms builder with hosted /f/ pages and site embedding; submissions
become contacts with timeline, task, consent evidence and a new
form.submitted automation trigger. Hosted /s/ sites on the existing
Puck editor with a live-site section library, industry templates and
optional AI copy from approved knowledge; drafts never touch live pages
and only managers publish an exact copy of the draft. Versioned,
approval-gated knowledge base with full-text search used by the AI.
The SQL test runner now applies every phase migration.

